      "widgets_values": [
        "Equirectangular 360-degree panoramic video of the supplied alpine mountain ridge at golden hour. Preserve the mountains, rocky hiking trail, grass, distant valley and warm sunset lighting. The orange-jacketed hiker completes the jump, lands naturally on the trail, and steadies their balance. The camera remains completely fixed at one position and orientation, at a constant eye height with a level horizon. No camera translation, panning, rotation or zoom. Keep the entire surrounding landscape coherent and solid, continuous left-right wrap, consistent sky and ground. No cuts, no sudden rotation."
