      "widgets_values": [
        "LTX 2.5: exact 121-frame tested fixed-camera baseline. Load pano_2k_00013_.png or your own seamless panorama. 1024x512 / 24 fps / seed 42 / 8 Euler-simple steps / CFG 1. Spherical RoPE blend 1, threshold 10, radius 1; native dual-rotation decode blend 1. The CameraMove filename is retained for compatibility; changing motion requires a new visual check.\nNo panorama LoRA, rolling or wrapped noise. Exports come directly from the selected wrap-aware decoder. Keep full 2:1 ERP framing. Longitude-wrap qualification does not establish pole quality, subject identity or camera-path accuracy. See example_workflows/README.md."
      ],
